    "title": "Invocation manifest for Bruker to NIfTI converter"
  },
  "description": "We are preparing to run the Bruker\u2011to\u2011NIfTI conversion on the dataset recorded with a ParaVision system. The study is identified as **MouseBrainStudy_2023** and the conversion will retrieve the reconstruction data (Get\u202fReco\u202f=\u202ftrue) while skipping the acquisition parameters (Get\u202fACQP\u202f=\u202ffalse). Because the data include diffusion\u2011weighted imaging, the B0 volume will be saved (Save\u202fB0\u202fif\u202fDWI\u202f=\u202ftrue). Slope correction will be applied, the output will include a human\u2011readable description, and method information will not be extracted (Get\u202fMethod\u202f=\u202ffalse).  \n\nThe conversion will be fairly verbose (Verbosity\u202fLevel\u202f=\u202f2) and will produce NIfTI files in version\u202f2 format. Spatial orientation will be encoded with a Q\u2011form code of\u202f1 and an S\u2011form code of\u202f2, and the S\u2011form correction will be applied (Correct\u202fSlope\u202f=\u202ftrue).",
  "reference_json": {
    "config": {
      "Get Reco": true,
      "Study Name": "MouseBrainStudy_2023",
      "Get ACQP": false,
      "Save B0 if DWI": true,
      "Q-form Code": 1,
      "Correct Slope": true,
      "Save Human Readable": true,
      "Get Method": false,
      "Verbosity Level": 2,
      "Nifti Version": 2,
      "S-form Code": 2
    },
    "inputs": {
